{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24104","headline":"自在 · 白居易","name":"自在","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杲杲冬日光，明暖真可爱。\n移榻向阳坐，拥裘仍解带。\n小奴搥我足，小婢搔我背。\n自问我爲谁，胡然独安泰。\n安泰良有以，与君论梗概。\n心了事未了，饥寒迫於外。\n事了心未了，念虑煎於内。\n我今实多幸，事与心和会。\n内外及中间，了然无一碍。\n所以日阳中，向君言自在。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}